/**
@dir mqbscm

@brief The `MQBSCM` (BlazingMQ Source Control Management) package provides
versioning information for `mqb` library components.

This package provides versioning information that is incorporated into every
release of the `mqb` package group library. This versioning information is in
turn available to all clients of `mqb` both at run time and by inspection of
appropriate .o files.
*/
